00:10:25,297 --> 00:10:27,601
sounds like it belongs in a power

284
00:10:27,601 --> 00:10:28,020
plant.

285
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,452
The Chiron has ten radiators.

286
00:10:30,632 --> 00:10:32,175
They cool the engine,

287
00:10:32,175 --> 00:10:33,277
the charge air,

288
00:10:33,277 --> 00:10:34,379
the engine oil,

289
00:10:34,379 --> 00:10:37,317
the transmission, the rear differential,

290
00:10:37,317 --> 00:10:38,933
and the hydraulic oil.

291
00:10:39,284 --> 00:10:41,542
The water pump moves about eight hundred

292
00:10:41,542 --> 00:10:43,799
liters of coolant per minute through the

293
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,195
engine.

294
00:10:44,375 --> 00:10:47,807
The high-temperature loop holds thirty-seven liters of

295
00:10:47,807 --> 00:10:50,540
coolant, and it circulates through the loop

296
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:52,002
in about three seconds.

297
00:10:52,182 --> 00:10:55,912
A second, low-temperature loop with twelve liters

298
00:10:55,912 --> 00:10:58,805
keeps the charge air from overheating,

299
00:10:58,805 --> 00:11:00,936
even in stop-and-go traffic.

300
00:11:01,287 --> 00:11:02,633
Then there is the air.

301
00:11:02,813 --> 00:11:05,245
More than sixty thousand liters of air

302
00:11:05,245 --> 00:11:07,740
pass through the engine every minute at

303
00:11:07,740 --> 00:11:08,444
full power.

304
00:11:08,624 --> 00:11:10,951
The big intakes on the sides,

305
00:11:10,951 --> 00:11:12,717
just behind the doors,

306
00:11:12,717 --> 00:11:14,081
feed that engine.

307
00:11:14,261 --> 00:11:15,714
And under the car,

308
00:11:15,714 --> 00:11:17,814
a flat floor with strakes,

309
00:11:17,814 --> 00:11:21,287
active diffusers, and NACA ducts pulls cool

310
00:11:21,287 --> 00:11:23,386
air across the drivetrain.

311
00:11:23,737 --> 00:11:26,314
The fuel side is just as extreme.

312
00:11:26,494 --> 00:11:29,655
The engine uses duplex fuel injection with

313
00:11:29,655 --> 00:11:32,589
thirty-two injectors, two per cylinder.

314
00:11:32,769 --> 00:11:35,887
And the official mixed fuel consumption is

315
00:11:35,887 --> 00:11:39,153
twenty-two point five liters per one hundred

316
00:11:39,153 --> 00:11:41,825
kilometers, which is about ten and a

317
00:11:41,825 --> 00:11:43,458
half miles per gallon,

318
00:11:43,458 --> 00:11:45,165
and that is the gentle,

319
00:11:45,165 --> 00:11:46,353
everyday figure.

320
00:11:46,703 --> 00:11:48,758
The exhaust is titanium.

321
00:11:48,938 --> 00:11:52,554
There are four pre-catalytic converters and two

322
00:11:52,554 --> 00:11:55,171
main catalysts, and one of them is

323
00:11:55,171 --> 00:11:58,018
described as about six times the size

324
00:11:58,018 --> 00:12:00,942
of a normal car's catalytic converter.

325
00:12:01,122 --> 00:12:04,931
The titanium silencer weighs only about forty-four

326
00:12:04,931 --> 00:12:05,464
pounds.

327
00:12:05,644 --> 00:12:07,980
And the car has six tailpipes,

328
00:12:07,980 --> 00:12:10,549
four at the back and two pointing

329
00:12:10,549 --> 00:12:10,939
down.

330
00:12:11,289 --> 00:12:14,167
Even the turbocharging is designed around this

331
00:12:14,167 --> 00:12:14,667
problem.

332
00:12:14,847 --> 00:12:17,784
The Chiron uses two-stage turbocharging.

333
00:12:17,964 --> 00:12:20,343
Two turbochargers work from launch,

334
00:12:20,343 --> 00:12:22,246
and the other two join in at

335
00:12:22,246 --> 00:12:24,829
about three thousand eight hundred r p

336
00:12:24,829 --> 00:12:24,965
m.

337
00:12:25,145 --> 00:12:27,691
That is how the car delivers peak

338
00:12:27,691 --> 00:12:30,468
torque from two thousand all the way

339
00:12:30,468 --> 00:12:32,166
to six thousand r p m,

340
00:12:32,166 --> 00:12:34,634
without the huge lag of four big

341
00:12:34,634 --> 00:12:35,792
turbos at once.

342
00:12:36,142 --> 00:12:38,153
So here is the real secret of

343
00:12:38,153 --> 00:12:38,916
the Chiron.

344
00:12:39,096 --> 00:12:42,136
Its greatest achievement is not making fifteen

345
00:12:42,136 --> 00:12:43,392
hundred horsepower.

346
00:12:43,572 --> 00:12:45,972
Plenty of tuners can make big power

347
00:12:45,972 --> 00:12:47,206
for a few seconds.

348
00:12:47,386 --> 00:12:51,492
Its achievement is surviving fifteen hundred horsepower,

349
00:12:51,492 --> 00:12:54,352
all day, at four hundred kilometers per

350
00:12:54,352 --> 00:12:56,991
hour, with air conditioning on and a

351
00:12:56,991 --> 00:12:58,311
warranty attached.

352
00:12:58,661 --> 00:13:01,416
And that also explains a detail people

353
00:13:01,416 --> 00:13:02,213
