354
00:13:02,393 --> 00:13:05,140
The Chiron uses the same displacement and

355
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:07,753
the same number of turbochargers as the

356
00:13:07,753 --> 00:13:08,221
Veyron.

357
00:13:08,401 --> 00:13:11,227
Motor Authority says the power gain of

358
00:13:11,227 --> 00:13:14,721
