545
00:20:23,052 --> 00:20:23,911
Number one.

546
00:20:24,091 --> 00:20:27,191
A normal Chiron is always held back.

547
00:20:27,371 --> 00:20:29,542
It needs a special key to reach

548
00:20:29,542 --> 00:20:31,083
