549
00:20:31,083 --> 00:20:33,534
and even the three hundred mile per

550
00:20:33,534 --> 00:20:36,055
hour record car was a special build.

551
00:20:36,235 --> 00:20:38,801
Customer cars never got to repeat it.

552
00:20:39,151 --> 00:20:40,079
Number two.

553
00:20:40,259 --> 00:20:42,641
The real engineering story is heat,

554
00:20:42,641 --> 00:20:43,661
not horsepower.

555
00:20:43,841 --> 00:20:46,653
An engine that makes about fifteen hundred

556
00:20:46,653 --> 00:20:50,135
